	<item>
		<title>NASA Sets Launch Date for Example Weather Satellite</title>
		<link>https://www.nasa.gov/news-release/nasa-sets-launch-date-for-example-weather-satellite/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nasa.gov/?post_type=press-release&#038;p=2000001</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[NASA set a launch date for a new weather satellite.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>NASA has set a launch date for a new weather satellite that will help forecasters track storms. The satellite will orbit about 22,000 miles above Earth.</p><p>The launch is planned for next spring.</p>]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
